{"id": "85844", "name": "משיק לפולינום ממעלה שלישית בנקודה – בשלבים (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Find the equation of the line tangent to \\(p(x):=\\){{CT:0}} at the point \\(x={{CT:1}}\\).</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-right:8px\">a</span></div><p>Differentiate {{CT:0}} with respect to \\(x\\).</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\( p'(x) = \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><div style=\"margin-top:6px\">[[feedback:prt1]]</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-right:8px\">b</span></div><p>Evaluate your derivative at \\(x={{CT:1}}\\).</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div><div style=\"margin-top:6px\">[[feedback:prt2]]</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-right:8px\">c</span></div><p>Hence, find the equation of the tangent line to \\(p\\) at \\(x={{CT:1}}\\).</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(y=\\) [[input:ans3]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans3]]</div><div style=\"margin-top:6px\">[[feedback:prt3]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> The tangent line at \\(x=a\\) passes through \\((a,p(a))\\) with slope \\(p'(a)\\): differentiate, evaluate the derivative at the point, and write the line.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — The derivative (part a)</b><br><p>The derivative of {{CT:0}} with respect to \\(x\\) is</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:2}}. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — The slope at the point (part b)</b><br><p>If we substitute \\(x={{CT:1}}\\) into \\(p'(x)\\) we have \\(p'({{CT:1}})={{CT:3}}\\).</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 3 — The tangent line (part c)</b><br><p>The tangent line is given by the equation</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ y = m(x-a)+c \\]</p><p>where \\(m\\) is the gradient of the line, \\(a\\) is the point at which the tangent line is being constructed and \\(c:=p(a)\\). In our case we have \\(a={{CT:1}}\\), \\(m={{CT:3}}\\) and \\(c=p({{CT:1}})={{CT:4}}\\). Combining these we have</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ y={{CT:5}} = {{CT:6}}. \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "", "prtcorrect": "<p>Correct answer, well done.</p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p>Your answer is partially correct.</p>", "prtincorrect": "<p>Incorrect answer.</p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "ta1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\"><b>Part a — correct.</b></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\"><b>Part a — incorrect.</b></div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "subst(x=pt,ans1)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\"><b>Part b — incorrect.</b></div>"}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "ta1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-2-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\"><b>Part b — correct.</b></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-2-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">Your answer to this part is correct, however you have got part a wrong! Please try both parts again!</div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt3", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans3", "tans": "ta3", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\"><b>Part c — correct.</b></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\"><b>Part c — incorrect.</b></div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["c", "p", "pt", "ta1", "ta2", "ta3"], "nvariants": 27}